cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this study, its harness or its published attempts, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "nl2sql-reliability: pass@k versus pass^k for text-to-SQL on an expert-corrected answer key"
abstract: >-
  Asks every question of Arcwise-Plat-SQL (expert-corrected BIRD Mini-Dev) ten times per model
  and compares capability (pass@k) with reliability (pass^k). 14,880 scored generations from
  Qwen2.5-Coder 7B and 3B at temperature 0.2, with every attempt published.
authors:
  - family-names: Vishe
    given-names: Mohan Prakash
repository-code: "https://github.com/MohanVishe/nl2sql-reliability"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-18
keywords:
  - text-to-sql
  - nl2sql
  - evaluation
  - reliability
  - pass^k
